<main class="write-main"><div class="writer-head"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Retain enquiries · control notifications</span><h1>Contact controls & review</h1><p>All new contact messages are held for review. Owner notifications and sender acknowledgements are sent only after you review and release that exact enquiry.</p></div><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/communication?tab=inbox')?>">Communication inbox</a></div>
<?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="program-card program-editor"><h2>Screening controls</h2><p>Hidden-field trap · one-use server-issued form token · five submissions per IP per minute · sender limits · duplicate notification suppression. Every enquiry needs owner review before contact emails. Repeated or excessive submissions are rejected before another record is saved; existing messages are preserved.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="settings"><?php foreach(['sender_hour'=>'Messages per sender per hour','sender_day'=>'Messages per sender per day','duplicate_hours'=>'Duplicate look-back (hours)','links'=>'Link count triggering review']as$k=>$label):?><label><?=e($label)?><input type="number" name="<?=e($k)?>" min="1" max="<?=$k==='duplicate_hours'?168:($k==='links'?30:100)?>" value="<?=(int)$guard[$k]?>" required></label><?php endforeach;?><button class="wbtn">Save controls</button></form></section>
<section><h2>Held enquiries · latest 200 screened records</h2><p>All messages, including older held records and messages retained without notification, remain in the Communication inbox and Reader desk.</p><?php if(!$reviews):?><p>No held enquiries in this window.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach($reviews as$item):$r=$item['enquiry'];$m=$item['meta'];?><article class="program-card"><h3><?=e($r['reference'])?> · <?=e($r['first_name'].' '.$r['last_name'])?></h3><p><?=e($r['email'])?> · <?=e($r['created_at'])?></p><p><strong>Review reasons:</strong> <?=e(implode('; ',$m['reasons']))?></p><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><?=e($r['message'])?></div><p><a href="<?=url('/write/readers/enquiries/'.$r['id'])?>">Open enquiry record</a></p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)$r['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<?=(int)$m['version']?>"><label>Review note<textarea name="review_note" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="review_consent" value="1">I reviewed this message and approve its owner notification and sender acknowledgement</label><div class="program-actions"><button class="wbtn primary" name="action" value="release">Approve this enquiry’s emails</button><button class="wbtn" name="action" value="keep">Retain without notification</button></div></form></article><?php endforeach;?></section></main><link rel="stylesheet" href="<?=asset('css/program.css')?>">
